WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240
The candidate test must earn acceptance.

00:00:02.347 --> 00:00:05.600
Start with domain-owned
intent and versioned context.

00:00:05.893 --> 00:00:09.840
AI produces a proposal, which
a reviewer checks before execution.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.840
The pipeline challenges it
on the normal build and a known fault.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:18.160
If a required check fails, reject
the candidate, preserve the evidence

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:22.480
and return it for rework.
The maintained suite stays unchanged.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:26.800
The guided example ends at rejection
to make that boundary visible.
